<title>JAPAN: Sankyo to expand Mevalotin production facilities.</title>
<headline>Sankyo to expand Mevalotin production facilities.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceutical maker Sankyo Co Ltd said on Thursday that it would expand facilities to produce its drug Mevalotin, which combats excessive cholesterol and lipid in blood.</p>
<p>The planned expansion is in view of robust overseas demand for the anti-hyperlipidemic drug, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Sankyo hopes to expand facilities at its Onahama plant in northern Japan in 1997 but no specifics have been decided yet.</p>
</text>
